    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d126-a1">

                <pb facs="0214" n="948" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg948"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Governor McIntire to
                        Mr. Uhl.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Denver, Colo.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-07"><hi rendition="#italic">June 7,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inclose a copy of a letter from the district attorney of the
                    third judicial district, in which the county of Huerfano lies. The cause of
                    delay in receiving a reply from him is indicated in the first part of the
                    letter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert W. McIntire</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Governor.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
